            null,
            "1.3.0",
            null,
            null,
            "27 March 2026",
            null,
            null,
            "\u2022 Added new CNSA 2.0 objective\nrequirements: MSC-SR-24, MSC-VG-19,\nMSC-VG-20, and MSC-AA-4.\n\u2022 Added new Approved CNSA 2.0\nAlgorithms Tables 2, 7, and 11.\n\u2022 Updated Section 2 to include CNSS\nPolicy 15 algorithms.\n\u2022 Added Section 5.11 -- CNSA 2.0 IPsec.\n\u2022 Provided language clarification in\nsection 5.1 and 4.1.3 regarding Public\nInternet.\n\u2022 Updated MSC-GD-10, MSC-GD-11, MSC-\nGD-15, MSC-SR-21 language to add\nmore clarity.\n\u2022 Changed Management Workstation to\nAdministrative Workstation.\n\u2022 Updated MSC-PS-8, MSC-PS-14, MSC-\nDM-20, MSC-DM-21 to remove\n\u201cOptional\u201d.\n\u2022 Updated Table 7 and included SHA-512.\n\u2022 Various formatting and document\ncleanup.",
            null,
